.TH GREPLEO 1 "" "grepleo @VERSION@"
.SH NAME
grepleo \- job search on InfoJobs, Indeed and LinkedIn with criteria evaluation
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B grepleo
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B grepleo
is a GTK application that searches job offers on InfoJobs, Indeed and LinkedIn through Apify,
evaluates each offer against your profiles and shows which criteria you meet, which you do not and
which cannot be known (summary cards do not include the full description). It also gives an overview
of the requirements most asked for, keeps the offers you have seen and lets you mark them as favourite,
applied or discarded, and exports the results as an HTML report or a CSV table.
.PP
The evaluation runs on your computer with local rules: only the keywords and the location of the search
leave it. An Apify token, set in
.IR Preferences ,
is needed to search; it is kept in the system keyring.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/grepleo/settings.json
User settings: language, theme and maximum spend per search.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/grepleo/grepleo.db
Local database with profiles, saved searches, offers and their status.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B LANGUAGE
Interface language when it is set to \(lqSystem\(rq in the preferences.
.SH SEE ALSO
Apify: https://apify.com/
.PP
Project page: https://github.com/seguidodoblado/grepleo
